PTX MP+atom-release.sys+dsmem-remote-writer
"Message passing in the reader's shared memory, written from another CTA of the cluster, the flag set by atom.release.sys"
{
x=0 @cta 1;
f=0 @cta 1;
P0:r9=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                       | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0         ;
 st.weak.shared::cluster x, 1                   | ld.acquire.sys.shared::cta r0, f ;
 atom.release.sys.shared::cluster.exch r9, f, 1 | ld.weak.shared::cta r1, x        ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
